    bottomLine: "For a home buyer who used to shop Vision, this is the current Johnson Health Tech equivalent at about a quarter of the T600E’s price.",
    description: "The 7.8 AT is Horizon’s top home treadmill. Our review, checked on 5 November 2026 against Horizon’s US store and independent coverage, gives a 22 by 60-inch deck, 0.5 to 12 mph, 0 to 15% incline, a 375 lb maximum user weight and Bluetooth FTMS app connectivity, with a lifetime frame and motor warranty, five years on parts and two on labour. It was $1,999 at Horizon that day.",
  },
  {
    id: "life-fitness-run-cx",
    name: "Life Fitness Run CX",
    brand: "Life Fitness",
    category: "Premium Home Alternative from Another Club Brand",
    badge: "Premium Home Pick",
