        <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 mb-6 flex-wrap">
          <span class="bg-[#FF5A1F] text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Buyer’s Guide
          </span>
          <span class="bg-green-500 text-white px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">
            Updated November 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Vision Fitness Treadmills: <span class="text-[#5AA9FF]">The T600 Today, and the Home Models Before It</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          Vision Fitness, a Johnson Health Tech brand, used to sell a full line of home treadmills through specialty dealers — the T9200, T9800, TF20, T40 and T80 among them. Its US site now lists one treadmill, the light-commercial T600 with an LED or touchscreen console, and directs buyers to a local Vision office. Here is what the T600 is and costs, what the old home models were, which of them are in the January 2026 recall, and where to look instead.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="bg-[#FF5A1F] hover:bg-[#E64F16] text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm">
            The Short Answer
          </a>
          <a href="#recalls" class="bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-black no-underline transition-colors uppercase tracking-widest text-sm border border-white/20">
            The 2026 Recall
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <!-- Author & Meta -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 py-8 border-b border-gray-100">
        <img src="/authors/shaheer-ali-khan.png" alt="Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD" width="48" height="48" class="w-12 h-12 rounded-full" />
        <div>
          <p class="font-bold text-gray-900 leading-tight"><a href="/editorial-standards/#who" rel="author" class="text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Shaheer Ali Khan, PhD</a></p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-tight">Exercise Physiology & Biomechanics Specialist · ACSM-EP, CSCS</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block w-px h-8 bg-gray-200"></div>
        <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm">
          Last Updated: <strong class="text-gray-700">November 5, 2026</strong>
        </p>
        <div class="ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="1.3k" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="not-prose my-10 bg-blue-50 border border-blue-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-700 m-0 leading-relaxed">
          <strong class="text-gray-900">What we checked, and what we have not done.</strong> On
          5 November 2026 we checked Vision Fitness's US site (its home page, cardio catalogue and the T600/T600E
          product page), Fitness Supply's US listing for the T600E with its warranty terms, other US, Canadian,
          Australian and UK dealer listings for the T600 seen in search results, TreadmillReviews.com and Treadmill
          Doctor coverage of the T9200 and manuals and parts listings for older models, the US Consumer Product Safety
          Commission's recall database for Vision Fitness and Johnson Health Tech (recall 26-203 of January 2026 and
          recall 06-556 of 2006), and Horizon's and Life Fitness's US stores for the alternatives, as checked for our
          reviews of those machines the same day. On 9 November 2026 we replaced the T600 and T600E cards with the
          Matrix T5x and NordicTrack Commercial 2450, which are sold on Amazon; their figures are those checked for our
          Matrix T5x review and heavy-duty treadmill guide. Vision publishes no prices; the T600E price is one dealer's, and
          dealer prices vary by region and change often. Conflicting figures are set out in the text and kept off the
          cards. We have not tested any Vision treadmill. As an Amazon Associate we earn from qualifying purchases;
          that does not change what we say.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-8">
      <div class="not-prose bg-orange-50 border border-orange-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-3">Our Top Picks</h2>
        <ul class="list-none m-0 p-0">
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Closest on Amazon to the T600:</span>
            <a href="#matrix-t5x" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Matrix T5x</a>
            <a href="#matrix-t5x" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Touchscreen Alternative on Amazon:</span>
            <a href="#nordictrack-commercial-2450" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">NordicTrack Commercial 2450</a>
            <a href="#nordictrack-commercial-2450" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Best for Most Homes:</span>
            <a href="#horizon-7-8-at" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Horizon 7.8 AT</a>
            <a href="#horizon-7-8-at" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
          <li class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline gap-x-2 py-2 border-b border-orange-100 last:border-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-[#FF5A1F]">Premium Home Pick:</span>
            <a href="#life-fitness-run-cx" class="font-bold text-gray-900 no-underline hover:underline">Life Fitness Run CX</a>
            <a href="#life-fitness-run-cx" class="ml-auto text-xs font-bold text-[#0F62FE] no-underline hover:underline">Jump to review &darr;</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6">
        <h2 class="flex items-center gap-2 text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mt-0 mb-4">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5 text-[#FF5A1F]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h7"></path></svg>
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#short-answer" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">1. The Short Answer</a>
          <a href="#who-is-vision" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">2. Who Makes Vision Fitness Treadmills?</a>
          <a href="#t600" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">3. The T600</a>
          <a href="#older-models" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">4. Older Models</a>
          <a href="#recalls" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">5. The 2026 Recall</a>
          <a href="#alternatives" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">6. What to Buy Instead of a Vision Home Treadmill</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="flex items-start gap-2 text-[#0F62FE] no-underline font-medium text-sm hover:underline">7. Frequently Asked Questions</a>
        </nav>
