                In January 2026 Johnson Health Tech recalled about 47,000 Matrix Retail and Vision treadmills, including the Vision T9800, TF20, T40 and T80 made from 2007 to January 2024, because the power cord can work loose and overheat. The remedy is a free locking power cord. A 2006 recall covered about 480 Premier consoles.
