          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">Common Mistakes Buying a Vision Treadmill</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">A Vision treadmill can be a solid buy, new or used, if you avoid these mistakes.</p>
          <div class="space-y-6 my-8">
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Buying a used TF20, T40, T80 or T9800 without checking the recall</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Units made from 2007 to January 2024 without a power-cord bracket are in the January 2026 recall. The fix is free, but check the serial number and whether the locking cord has been fitted before you pay.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Paying commercial money for home use you do not need</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The T600E cost $8,799 at the dealer price we confirmed. A Horizon 7.8 AT from the same parent company has the same deck size and incline for $1,999. Buy the T600 for multi-user or facility use, not for the badge.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Accepting a verbal warranty</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">Vision’s warranty terms vary by dealer, region and whether the treadmill is in home or commercial use. Ask for the written terms that apply to your use before you sign.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-red-50 border border-red-100 rounded-2xl p-6">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-red-900 mt-0 mb-2">Underestimating the size</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm m-0">The T600 is 85 inches long, 65 inches high and 408 lb, and does not fold. Measure the room, the doorways and the stairs, and confirm delivery and installation are included.</p>
